        "name": "USN-8066-1",
        "description": "Minh Pham Quang discovered that Rack did not correctly handle parsing certain paths, which could lead to a path traversal attack. An attacker could possibly use this issue to leak sensitive information. (CVE-2026-22860)  Ali Firas discovered that Rack did not correctly sanitize certain inputs. An attacker could possibly use this issue to execute arbitrary code. (CVE-2026-25500)",
